<title>DENMARK: Carlsberg says not in Hansa bid talks.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg says not in Hansa bid talks.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish brewery group Carlsberg said on Wednesday that it was not involved in negotiations on taking over Norway's A/S Hansa Brewery.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not been involved in any concrete negotiations on a possible takeover of Hansa from Orkla,&quot; Carlsberg director Michael Iuul told Reuters.</p>
<p>Last May Carlsberg, in co-operation with Norway's Mack and Borg breweries made an offer for Hansa, but later the two Norwegian brewers made their own independent bid for Hansa with the full agreement of the Copenhagen brewery.</p>
</text>
